  "Description": {
    "Cost": 31068004,
    "UIName": "Polyphemus",
    "Id": "chassisdef_polyphemus_PPH-O",
    "Name": "Polyphemus",
    "Details": "The primary configuration for the Polyphemus superheavy mounts a Improved Heavy Gauss Rife and a Longfire LRM-20 launcher. Further it sports two Clan tech ER PPC, how Grumium Creations acquired these weapons is still unknown, as is the clan ER Small Pulse Laser. An AMS Mk2 provides some defensive firepower. Altogether the loadout is meant to bring versatility to the Command 'Mech, allowing it to join the fray of battle where needed.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Command Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.35</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_polyphemus"
  },
