  "StockRole": "Command Superheavy",
  "YangsThoughts": "When Grumium Creations got a request from the Capellan Confederation for a new Command Mech that had to be even more potent than the Cyclops, the result was the superheavy OmniMech named the Polyphemus. At an impressive 180 tons and with a much improved Command Module, the design filled the role of Command Mech with ease. Utilizing the increase in space and weight capacity allows the engineers to not only increase the armor by a several tons, but to also add advanced Electronic Warfare Systems and ",
